<title>UK: LIFFE cocoa turns mixed, coffee up, sugar slips PM.</title>
<headline>LIFFE cocoa turns mixed, coffee up, sugar slips PM.</headline>
<text>
<p>COCOA -Turns mixed on hedging. Outright trade thins. Sep/Dec spread jumpy. At 1505 GMT, July down 1 at 994.</p>
<p>COFFEE - Up after Columbian threat strike. July up $22 at $1,692.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Down after commission switches in morning. Aug off 1.8 at 312.10.</p>
</text>
